[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 22620.628, "timestamp": "06:17:00", "text": "四、等等，我什么时候……等等，什么时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22623.59, "timestamp": "06:17:03", "text": "我什么时候加入的？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22625.868, "timestamp": "06:17:05", "text": "在Twitch上？所以，那会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22630.07, "timestamp": "06:17:10", "text": "我确定还有一秒钟。那应该是等等，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22632.05, "timestamp": "06:17:12", "text": "让我登录我的账户。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22633.15, "timestamp": "06:17:13", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22636.15, "timestamp": "06:17:16", "text": "你好。那就是我是6的附属会员。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22637.32, "timestamp": "06:17:17", "text": "几个月，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22638.59, "timestamp": "06:17:18", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22643.59, "timestamp": "06:17:23", "text": "正确的？是的。所以，这意味着五个月。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22647.27, "timestamp": "06:17:27", "text": "我一直处于这种节俭的状态。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22648.708, "timestamp": "06:17:28", "text": "零。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22651.67, "timestamp": "06:17:31", "text": "我不知道我到底持续了多久。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22654.91, "timestamp": "06:17:34", "text": "不知道需要多长时间"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22658.628, "timestamp": "06:17:38", "text": "首次亮相。我的意思是，我曾告诉过自己……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22661.75, "timestamp": "06:17:41", "text": "就像我想做的那样，如果你看到我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22664.708, "timestamp": "06:17:44", "text": "Twitter 目标，例如置顶帖子，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22667.51, "timestamp": "06:17:47", "text": "我不明白为什么我花了这么长时间"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22668.75, "timestamp": "06:17:48", "text": "采取"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22672.708, "timestamp": "06:17:52", "text": "出道等了挺久的。我曾"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22673.948, "timestamp": "06:17:53", "text": "用过的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22678.99, "timestamp": "06:17:58", "text": "这些头像也是如此。如果我记得"}]